<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it will auction 3.3 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     900 million pesos  23.93 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     900 million pesos  26.21 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  26.36 pct</p>
<p>    364 days     600 million pesos  23.76 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 150 milion UDIs worth of 1,092-day UDI bonds, and 800 million pesos worth of 728-day Bondes.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City Newsroom 525 7289559</p>
</text>
